      "label": "CALCULATION",
      "text": "Neither discounted cash flow template used on this site applies to TATACONSUM: Template A needs free cash flow to the firm to be positive in at least three of the last four years, and it was −₹1,628 crore in FY24 and −₹949 crore in FY25; Template B, for companies reinvesting at a return above their cost of capital, needs the median return on invested capital of the last three years to beat that cost, and it was 8.3% against 9.84%, so no model value is shown.",
